<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT - Australian Gold Index consolidation seen before rise.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Australian Gold Index consolidation seen before rise.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------Australian Gold Index----------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 1350 1400 1445 *RSI-14 46.40 *MA-10 1303.0</p>
<p>1275 - 1345  *Sup 1360 1300 1255 *MA-20 1289.4 *MA-40 1397.4</p>
<p>------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - Aug 1-----------------</p>
<p>*Index rise falters</p>
<p>*Leading indicators turning lower</p>
<p>*Signs still positive while above 1,255</p>
<p>*Australia gold index closed at 1,325.9 on Friday.</p>
